    "name": "Citizens Bank ATM Locator API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Citizens Bank ATM Locator API enables users to locate all Citizens Bank ATMs throughout the USA. The API supports queries by zip code, street address, or latitude and longitude coordinates, returning ATM location details including hours of operation and whether the location is a standalone ATM or part of another entity.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Citizens Bank Developer Support",
